#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:9 85c3a89b89334195998e0a0533900ec2
msgid "Soaring"
msgstr "热升气流飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:14 384890d4f46349dea2a5bf10c0dc1810
msgid ""
"The autonomous soaring functionality in ArduPilot allows the plane to "
"respond to rising air current (thermals) in order to extend endurance and "
"gain altitude with minimal use of the motor (soaring). Its full technical "
"description is available in"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 中的自主热升气流飞行功能允许飞机响应上升气流（热气流）以延长续航并以最少的电机使用量获得高度（热升气流飞行）。其完整技术描述见"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:18 0aa3385ccf7647a08e4f1636c4543db1
msgid ""
"*S. Tabor, I. Guilliard, A. Kolobov.* `ArduSoar: an Open-Source Thermalling "
"Controller for Resource-Constrained Autopilots "
"<https://arxiv.org/abs/1802.08215/>`_. *International Conference on "
"Intelligent Robots and Systems (IROS), 2018.*"
msgstr ""
"*S. Tabor, I. Guilliard, A. Kolobov.* `ArduSoar: an Open-Source Thermalling "
"Controller for Resource-Constrained Autopilots "
"<https://arxiv.org/abs/1802.08215/>`_. *International Conference on "
"Intelligent Robots and Systems (IROS), 2018.*"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:20 04ed004a085d4dd08c83d986f4d97671
msgid ""
"Use of an airspeed sensor is strongly recommended in order to obtain optimum"
" performance. Use without a sensor could yield unsatisfactory results. "
"Consistent operation without an airspeed sensor is a pending future "
"development."
msgstr "强烈建议使用空速传感器以获得最优性能。不使用传感器可能导致不理想的结果。无空速传感器的一致运行是未来待开发的功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:24 fc6c7fd8643f4958a8bc2d2fb4cdc03a
msgid ""
"This picture shows the different phases of flight when using the soaring "
"functionality:"
msgstr "此图展示了使用热升气流飞行功能时的不同飞行阶段："

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:27 b181d6b3e8cb4508bfbb6f795ed21370
msgid ""
"If modes AUTO, FBWB or CRUISE are entered, and Soaring is enabled, the "
"throttle is set to zero provided the aircraft is above "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` altitude and the aircraft then begins "
"gliding."
msgstr ""
"如果进入 Auto、FBWB 或 Cruise 模式，并且启用了翱翔功能，则只要飞行器高于 "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` 高度，油门将被设置为零，飞行器开始滑翔。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:28 d427cbc2b9234b1a8cc2d6220a240468
msgid ""
"In AUTO, if the aircraft descends to :ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` "
"altitude, throttle is re-enabled and the aircraft will begin to climb to the"
" altitude of the next waypoint. If that waypoint altitude is less than "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` altitude, then Soaring can not begin"
" before reaching the waypoint. If it is above "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` altitude, then Soaring can occur "
"once that altitude has been reached. In FBWB or CRUISE modes, if  "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` altitude is reached, an RTL will be "
"initiated, so the pilot must disable Soaring, or change to a mode other than"
" FBWB or CRUISE to climb back above :ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` "
"to begin gliding again and prevent an RTL beginning."
msgstr ""
"在 Auto 模式中，如果飞行器下降至 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` "
"高度，油门将重新启用，飞行器将开始爬升至下一航点的高度。如果该航点高度低于 "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` 高度，则在到达航点之前无法开始翱翔。如果高于 "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` 高度，则一旦达到该高度即可开始翱翔。在 FBWB 或 Cruise "
"模式中，如果达到 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` 高度，将启动 RTL，因此飞手必须禁用翱翔，或切换到 FBWB 或"
" Cruise 以外的模式，爬升回 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` 以上以重新开始滑翔，并防止 RTL "
"启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:29 949eedfe49b04db7a5572a0b9ca2339b
msgid ""
"When the aircraft reaches :ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` altitude, "
"throttle is set to zero again."
msgstr "当飞行器达到 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` 高度时，油门再次被设置为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:30 c471e713ee644fc6a06a9992178efd90
msgid ""
"If, during gliding flight, the air is estimated to be rising at more than "
":ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>` and the :ref:`RC switch position<soaring_rc-"
"switch>` allows it, the aircraft will automatically enter LOITER mode. While"
" in LOITER mode the aircraft will adjust the loiter position to better "
"centre the thermal."
msgstr ""
"如果在滑翔飞行中，估计空气上升速度超过 :ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>` 且 "
":ref:`遥控开关位置<soaring_rc-switch>` 允许，飞行器将自动进入 Loiter 模式。在 Loiter "
"模式下，飞行器将调整盘旋位置以更好地居中热气流。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:32 c6e355d93792498ca4af5c966de51185
msgid "LOITER mode is exited under the following conditions:"
msgstr "在以下条件下退出 Loiter 模式："

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:34 6078d5d0a1074d1daf837e9a96922cb9
msgid ":ref:`SOAR_ALT_MAX<SOAR_ALT_MAX>` is reached."
msgstr "达到 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_MAX<SOAR_ALT_MAX>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:35 ac64c0b496c34388a873bc715e36ca02
msgid ":ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` is reached."
msgstr "达到 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:36 aba5ef98a1a44acd9442e55a460cc6fd
msgid "Flight mode is changed by the pilot."
msgstr "飞手更改飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:37 5ad8032383a544c89f21e47603844b17
msgid ""
"The estimate of achievable climb rate falls below "
":ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>`, and thermalling has lasted at least "
":ref:`SOAR_MIN_THML_S<SOAR_MIN_THML_S>` seconds."
msgstr ""
"可实现爬升速率的估计低于 :ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>`，且热升气流飞行已持续至少 "
":ref:`SOAR_MIN_THML_S<SOAR_MIN_THML_S>` 秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:39 c295454dd5a44784bc0456b6a47a8f60
msgid ""
"The aircraft drifts more than :ref:`SOAR_MAX_DRIFT<SOAR_MAX_DRIFT>` - see "
":ref:`Limit maximum distance from home<soaring_maximum-distance-from-home>`"
msgstr ""
"飞机偏移超过 :ref:`SOAR_MAX_DRIFT<SOAR_MAX_DRIFT>` —— 参见 :ref:`限制距 Home "
"的最大距离<soaring_maximum-distance-from-home>`"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:41 cf3e751e74a0400ba08ee48a70dc19c7
msgid ""
"The flight mode will be returned to whatever it was before LOITER was "
"triggered. As an exception to this, if the previous mode was FBWB or CRUISE,"
" and thermalling ended due to reaching :ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>`, "
"RTL will be triggered instead."
msgstr ""
"飞行模式将恢复到触发 Loiter 之前的模式。例外情况是，如果之前的模式是 FBWB 或 Cruise，且由于达到 "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` 而结束盘旋热气流，则将改为触发 RTL。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:47 e315c38b409e4b429a0e0dbfbbd9c651
msgid "Hardware"
msgstr "硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:49 816347be0e9b436e8696682b5b7006d0
msgid ""
"To use your plane for soaring, it should ideally be a glider type aircraft "
"with a good lift to drag ratio and be equipped with an airspeed sensor."
msgstr "要将您的飞机用于热升气流飞行，理想情况下应是升阻比良好的滑翔机类型飞机，并配备空速传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:52 546b6f465107412891b3488777ad7f42
msgid ""
"Generally all boards support soaring, *except* those with firmware "
"limitations referred to on :ref:`this page <common-limited_firmware>`. As of"
" June 2020, non-supported boards include:"
msgstr ""
"通常所有飞控均支持翱翔，*除了* :ref:`此页面 <common-limited_firmware>` 上提及的具有固件限制的那些。截至 2020 "
"年 6 月，不受支持的飞控包括："

