#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:61 8a1b079d29a545fb8776c6fb933eb8d3
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:64 7bb4cd03f8104c99b2fc7fb255c19d32
msgid "Mission"
msgstr "任务"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:66 ba63267ee80c458e81c1daed82f58973
msgid ""
"The main requirement for a mission is that it take the aircraft above "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` so that gliding flight is initiated."
" To achieve this, set the waypoints' altitude(s) above "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>`."
msgstr ""
"任务的主要要求是将飞机带到 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` 以上以启动滑翔飞行。为此，将航点高度设置在 "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` 以上。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:71 5c7e0d05474a4dffb6c0971a33811469
msgid "TECS"
msgstr "TECS"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:73 ca29a4be16584175ba303dd6b0d923c6
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`TECS_SPDWEIGHT<TECS_SPDWEIGHT>` to 2.0. This makes sure the "
"aircraft will glide correctly with motor off."
msgstr "将 :ref:`TECS_SPDWEIGHT<TECS_SPDWEIGHT>` 设置为 2.0。这确保飞行器在电机关闭时能正确滑翔。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:76 11f5ed7d77e24c088d682a57c9bb94e6
msgid "Soaring Parameters"
msgstr "翱翔参数"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:79 7f04b8110b1f42b7a4bb65ed2a8c39f9
msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:81 41f7c75463bf478682ad95023e971dd9
msgid ""
"Set the parameter :ref:`SOAR_ENABLE<SOAR_ENABLE>` to 1 and refresh the "
"parameters. This will allow the other SOAR parameters to appear in the GCS."
msgstr ""
"将参数 :ref:`SOAR_ENABLE<SOAR_ENABLE>` 设置为 1 并刷新参数。这将允许其他 SOAR 参数在 GCS 中显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:85 ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:158
#: 83f49b6473cd47fbb57a477f8885229c fc2cb959e465448db4f0412291b4920c
msgid "Drag Polar"
msgstr "阻力极线"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:87 f16ffa95e89447b794a42a49d0102eb4
msgid ""
"To work out how fast the air is rising or sinking the autopilot needs to "
"know the aircraft's sink rate for a given airspeed in still air. This is "
"related to the drag polar of the plane and is specified using the SOAR_POLAR"
" parameters. :ref:`SOAR_POLAR_K<SOAR_POLAR_K>` is the most important one to "
"set initially and is calculated using the following formula:"
msgstr ""
"为计算空气上升或下沉的速度，飞控需要了解飞机在静止空气中特定空速下的下沉速率。这与飞机的阻力极线相关，使用 SOAR_POLAR "
"参数指定。:ref:`SOAR_POLAR_K<SOAR_POLAR_K>` 是最重要的初始设置参数，使用以下公式计算："

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:93 02a6d6afb15d48dcaa21547f620f808a
msgid ""
":ref:`SOAR_POLAR_K<SOAR_POLAR_K>` = 16*Weight/Area (weight in kg, area in "
"metres squared)."
msgstr ":ref:`SOAR_POLAR_K<SOAR_POLAR_K>` = 16 × 重量/翼面积（重量单位为千克，面积单位为平方米）。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:96 b0f8f8033ce24e198e1968f626eb0dd2
msgid ""
":ref:`SOAR_POLAR_K<SOAR_POLAR_K>` = 703*Weight/Area (weight in oz, area in "
"inches squared)."
msgstr ":ref:`SOAR_POLAR_K<SOAR_POLAR_K>` = 703 × 重量/翼面积（重量单位为盎司，面积单位为平方英寸）。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:99 f8547ec773e748f2b0a54e63f03f4598
msgid "Calculating the other parameters is explained under tuning."
msgstr "其他参数的计算方法在调参部分说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:104 2aa3b9d566f74672a41541fd9b272ffb
msgid "RC switch (Optional)"
msgstr "遥控开关（可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:106 988aadfe4e794f16b1d4f3301bc1870a
msgid ""
"You can use a 2-position RC switch to control when the autopilot can use "
"soaring. Use any available RC Option with ``RCx_OPTION`` value 88. The 2 "
"positions have the following effect."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用双位遥控开关来控制飞控何时可以使用翱翔功能。使用任何可用的遥控选项，``RCx_OPTION`` 值为 88。两个位置的效果如下。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:108 c7821353868a43aba5fde6641800270f
msgid ""
"Below 1700us. Soaring is disabled (equivalent to setting SOAR_ENABLE = 0). "
"Throttle will be used as normal. Switching to this from either of the "
"positions below, will disable Soaring and maintain the current flight mode."
msgstr ""
"低于 1700us：禁用翱翔（等同于设置 SOAR_ENABLE = 0）。油门将正常使用。从下方任一位置切换到此位置将禁用翱翔并保持当前飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:110 064166e0f43e47d883d1f7d3a37c1302
msgid ""
"Above 1700us. Fully automatic mode changes to LOITER from AUTO, FBWB or "
"CRUISE modes in response to detected rising air, and following of rising air"
" currents."
msgstr "高于 1700us：完全自动模式，在检测到上升气流时，从 Auto、FBWB 或 Cruise 模式切换到 Loiter，并追随上升气流。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:114 5905630f64004d19b940bd1322c02782
msgid "Loiter radius"
msgstr "Loiter 半径"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:116 e3171345535741c7bd9d5052da98f033
msgid ""
"The parameter :ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD<WP_LOITER_RAD>` sets how tight the loiter "
"circle is. For thermalling it is usually best to have the aircraft fly at a "
"30 - 45 degree bank angle. The corresponding loiter radius can be calculated"
" as about airspeed squared over ~10 (for 45 degrees) or ~6 (for 30 degrees),"
" from the equation"
msgstr ""
":ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD<WP_LOITER_RAD>` 参数设置盘旋圆的紧密程度。对于热气流盘旋，通常最好让飞行器以 30-45 "
"度倾斜角飞行。对应的盘旋半径可以用方程计算为约空速平方除以 ~10（45 度）或 ~6（30 度）"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:124 630b767b587d417799466ecc5dd6661e
msgid ""
"The tangent is for the desired bank angle. The resulting radius will be in "
"meters. Use g  = 9.81 m/s/s, and velocity (v) is in m/s. For example, if the"
" airspeed in loiter is 20m/s, then the :ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD<WP_LOITER_RAD>` "
"should be 40m for a 45 degree bank."
msgstr ""
"正切值用于所需倾斜角。结果半径单位为米。使用 g = 9.81 m/s/s，速度（v）单位为 m/s。例如，如果盘旋时空速为 20m/s，则 "
":ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD<WP_LOITER_RAD>` 对于 45 度倾斜角应为 40m。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:126 e0e4c4eafc114671bb2b691c557bb43d
msgid ""
"You should make sure that the limiting bank angle "
":ref:`ROLL_LIMIT_DEG<ROLL_LIMIT_DEG>` is set a bit larger than the desired "
"bank angle to give some room for manoeuvring."
msgstr ""
"您应确保限制倾斜角 :ref:`ROLL_LIMIT_DEG<ROLL_LIMIT_DEG>` 设置为比所需倾斜角稍大，以留出一些机动余量。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:130 914012ab9cef4be780305470de65c068
msgid "Set limits"
msgstr "设置限制"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:132 19dc5091f7c642e9b2cf51ec819faa82
msgid ""
"Because the soaring feature can follow rising air as required to gain "
"altitude, it is important to set limits to avoid it leaving the original "
"flight area completely. This is especially important in windy conditions as "
"the autopilot will try to follow thermals downwind."
msgstr ""
"由于翱翔功能可以根据需要追随上升气流以获得高度，重要的是设置限制以避免它完全离开原始飞行区域。这在有风的条件下尤为重要，因为飞控会尝试顺风追随热气流。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:135 998264853f6f4909b1b0759dec80f52c
msgid "Altitude limits"
msgstr "高度限制"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:137 fa8618f5e9d642d6948e9b11371f0201
msgid ""
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_MAX<SOAR_ALT_MAX>` sets the altitude you want the autopilot "
"to stop thermalling. :ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` sets the minimum "
"altitude you want the autopilot to descend to while gliding."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_MAX<SOAR_ALT_MAX>` "
"设置您希望飞控停止盘旋热气流的高度。:ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` 设置您希望飞控在滑翔时下降到的最低高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:142 a55ffd4fadca458591087ab795c62004
msgid "Spatial limits"
msgstr "空间限制"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:144 93b7a134bca349ddb466d6037ddc20f9
msgid ""
":ref:`Geofence <geofencing>` can be used to constrain the physical flight "
"area used. Set it up in the usual way."
msgstr ":ref:`地理围栏 <geofencing>` 可用于约束使用的物理飞行区域。按照通常方式设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:148 7f7b1dd82325458baf61299f64c745da
msgid "Tuning"
msgstr "调参"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:151 bbc6f1f078224afbb8474800751186b2
msgid "Triggering lift"
msgstr "触发升力"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:153 91881717849e40ad9de0bc38275ee177
msgid ""
":ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>` controls when the mode will be changed to "
"LOITER to begin thermalling. The default of 0.7m/s may be too low if you fly"
" in strong conditions. Increasing this value makes the aircraft more "
"\"picky\" about the lift it will try to circle in."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>` 控制何时将模式更改为 Loiter 以开始盘旋热气流。默认值 0.7m/s "
"在强气流条件下可能太低。增加此值会使飞行器对将要盘旋的升力更加「挑剔」。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:160 a4ab2013465d410186d32e54c179d664
msgid ""
"While the default settings for :ref:`SOAR_POLAR_B<SOAR_POLAR_B>` and "
":ref:`SOAR_POLAR_CD0<SOAR_POLAR_CD0>` should be OK for most foamie-style "
"glider aircraft, improving the accuracy of these parameters will improve how"
" your aircraft detects and centres lift. You can use `this spreadsheet "
"<https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1WA9CXRSPBc6mFydhQ3O_2SeDrQoFH1UrdiXd0PJ-"
"zE4/edit?usp=sharing>`__ to calculate better values from glide tests."
msgstr ""
"虽然 :ref:`SOAR_POLAR_B<SOAR_POLAR_B>` 和 :ref:`SOAR_POLAR_CD0<SOAR_POLAR_CD0>`"
" 的默认设置对大多数泡沫滑翔机风格的飞行器应该没问题，但提高这些参数的准确性将改善飞行器检测和居中升力的能力。您可以使用 `此电子表格 "
"<https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1WA9CXRSPBc6mFydhQ3O_2SeDrQoFH1UrdiXd0PJ-"
"zE4/edit?usp=sharing>`__ 从滑翔测试中计算更好的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:166 534dd76880e347f19c09c1ff0aba0732
msgid "Time hysteresis"
msgstr "时间滞后"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:168 ea452b49013a46f3a29d977c376f0dda
msgid "Adding hysteresis can reduce the frequency of mode changes."
msgstr "添加滞后可以减少模式切换的频率。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:170 ec6379672f054764811fc6fcc32770c5
msgid ""
":ref:`SOAR_MIN_THML_S<SOAR_MIN_THML_S>`: Minimum time to remain in LOITER "
"once entered for a thermal before exiting due to low lift or altitude "
"limits."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SOAR_MIN_THML_S<SOAR_MIN_THML_S>`：进入热气流 Loiter 后，在因升力低或高度限制而退出之前保持在 "
"Loiter 中的最短时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:172 22cf740d43494b1c89741ab0da71840b
msgid ""
":ref:`SOAR_MIN_CRSE_S<SOAR_MIN_CRSE_S>`: Minimum time to remain in glide "
"after exiting LOITER due to low lift or altitude limits before entering "
"LOITER mode again, or when entering Soaring initially."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SOAR_MIN_CRSE_S<SOAR_MIN_CRSE_S>`：因升力低或高度限制而退出 Loiter 后，在再次进入 Loiter "
"模式之前，或初始进入翱翔时，保持滑翔的最短时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:175 873250ab4e2e46c69b6942fecc85a916
msgid "TECS Tuning"
msgstr "TECS 调参"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:176 9215b40dab0d45f78cc08f0aed31f713
msgid ""
"For best results the TECS needs to be set up to fly the aircraft at a "
"consistent airspeed when gliding."
msgstr "为获得最佳结果，TECS 需要设置为在滑翔时以一致的空速飞行飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:179 ed85705bf1ed4135983e3d03efba8254
msgid ""
"If your aircraft has trouble maintaining airspeed accurately you can tune it"
" by confirming that :ref:`TECS_SPDWEIGHT<TECS_SPDWEIGHT>` is set to 2.0, "
":ref:`SOAR_ENABLE<SOAR_ENABLE>` to 1 and set :ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>`"
" to a large number, say 50.0, or use the :ref:`RC switch<soaring_rc-switch>`"
" to inhibit mode changes. This means that the aircraft will glide but will "
"never begin thermalling. Set :ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` to an "
"altitude high enough to allow a good length of time to be spent gliding."
msgstr ""
"如果您的飞行器在准确保持空速方面有困难，您可以通过确认 :ref:`TECS_SPDWEIGHT<TECS_SPDWEIGHT>` 设置为 "
"2.0，:ref:`SOAR_ENABLE<SOAR_ENABLE>` 设置为 1，并将 :ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>`"
" 设置为一个大数，例如 50.0，或使用 :ref:`遥控开关<soaring_rc-switch>` "
"来抑制模式切换，来进行调参。这意味着飞行器将滑翔但永远不会开始盘旋热气流。将 "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` 设置为足够高的高度，以允许足够长的滑翔时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:186 029f4e5d5b084888a9b2e21ff367a509
msgid ""
"Launch the aircraft and put it in AUTO mode. It should climb to "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` and then begin a gliding descent. "
"Watch the telemetry graphs or look at the Dataflash logs after the flight. "
"Is the aircraft maintaining the demanded airspeed? The actual and demanded "
"airspeed can be seen in the onboard log as ``TECS.sp`` and ``TECS.spdem``, "
"and via telemetry you can use ``NAV_CONTROLLER_OUTPUT.aspd_error``. Problems"
" can usually be fixed by increasing ``PTCH2SRV_IMAX`` and "
":ref:`TECS_INTEG_GAIN<TECS_INTEG_GAIN>` to achieve good airspeed tracking in"
" gliding flight."
msgstr ""
"发射飞行器并将其置于 Auto 模式。它应该爬升至 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` "
"然后开始滑翔下降。观察数传图表或在飞行后查看数据闪存日志。飞行器是否保持了要求的空速？实际和要求的空速可以在机载日志中以 ``TECS.sp`` 和 "
"``TECS.spdem`` 查看，通过数传可以使用 ``NAV_CONTROLLER_OUTPUT.aspd_error``。通常可以通过增加 "
"``PTCH2SRV_IMAX`` 和 :ref:`TECS_INTEG_GAIN<TECS_INTEG_GAIN>` "
"来解决问题，以实现滑翔飞行中良好的空速追踪。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:193 3d63fd848e034fd5ad43c39fea3fcd4b
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "注意事项"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:196 3bdc77ac2d8846aa850db7d6cdb555b1
msgid "MAVLINK Telemetry"
msgstr "MAVLink 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:198 a14ae0435f734df48adfbf2a91359020
msgid ""
"Currently, the only effect on telemetry is that when soaring is active the "
"climb rate item (VFR_HUD.climb) is altered. Rather that the estimated "
"vertical speed of the aircraft, the estimated vertical speed of the air mass"
" is sent. This field is used by Mission Planner and OpenTX radios to produce"
" vario audio output."
msgstr ""
"目前，热升气流飞行对数传的唯一影响是在热升气流飞行激活时，爬升速率项（VFR_HUD.climb）会发生变化。发送的不是飞机的估计垂直速度，而是空气团的估计垂直速度。此字段被"
" Mission Planner 和 OpenTX 遥控器用于产生航空仪音频输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:201 94f3fba8718a4dc5abf796bf83cfe0bb
msgid "Use of TECS synthetic airspeed"
msgstr "使用 TECS 合成空速"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring.rst:203 4f2e514ebac94cafa8381e79df2f97d7
msgid ""
"If your plane can't accommodate an airspeed sensor, it is possible to use "
"the TECS synthetic airspeed estimate "
":ref:`TECS_SYNAIRSPEED<TECS_SYNAIRSPEED>`. Make sure you read the warning "
"regarding this feature before deciding to use it. To use this feature, set "
"the parameter :ref:`TECS_SYNAIRSPEED<TECS_SYNAIRSPEED>` to 1."
msgstr ""
"如果您的飞机无法安装空速传感器，可以使用 TECS 合成空速估算 "
":ref:`TECS_SYNAIRSPEED<TECS_SYNAIRSPEED>`。在决定使用之前，请务必阅读有关此功能的警告。要使用此功能，请将参数 "
":ref:`TECS_SYNAIRSPEED<TECS_SYNAIRSPEED>` 设置为 1。"
